// 00_header — strategy() declaration (Agent 02). Execution model per PINE_CONSTRAINTS C-07:
//   process_orders_on_close = true  (MARKET_ON_CONFIRM fills at the confirmed bar close)
//   calc_on_every_tick      = false (AP-3 / I5: no intrabar entries)
